  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 large Vidalia or other sweet onion",
    "1 quart oil for frying, or as needed",
    "1.25 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup milk, or as needed",
    "1 large egg",
    "0.75 cup dry bread crumbs",
    "0.125 teaspoon seasoned salt, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zE1-FCoMmuLelXvUn9xFzAdeO_0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-82659-old-fashioned-onion-rings-DDMFS-ingredients-3x4-0a9df209518b486dafb2e3818cc9e5f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/82659/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice onion into 1/4-inch-thick rings. Heat oil in a deep-fryer to 365 degrees F (185 degrees C). Place a wire rack over a sheet of aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/po4g87I9ZVS064Jr1rqyiavayrs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-82659-old-fashioned-onion-rings-DDMFS-step-1-3x4-0ce00e58aa26498b94bce2bfcbf7a909.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/82659/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare breading station by setting out 3 wide, shallow dishes. Whisk flour, baking powder, and salt together in the first dish. Whisk milk and egg together in the second dish. Place bread crumbs in the third dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ofrPqXRQMFWhO_pKTAc29sqGc2Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-82659-old-fashioned-onion-rings-DDMFS-step-2-3x4-abdfaf1ddf22492b9fb3daaf1b299133.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/82659/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip each onion ring into the flour mixture, turning several times until fully coated with flour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x5ZsegseU9-FpUgTPfsSKxk9r1U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-82659-old-fashioned-onion-rings-DDMFS-step-3-3x4-4aa3d330119148cbb3ef21aa0e56ce0a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/82659/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to the egg mixture and use a fork to turn until coated. Lift onion with the fork and shake gently so excess liquid drips back into the dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oczr2O7a6B3M2-1GI-T6VI5MIRQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-82659-old-fashioned-onion-rings-DDMFS-step-4-3x4-1c44db98940d4ca68b48bc7261e0ae99.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/82659/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place onion in the bread crumbs and turn several times to coat, scooping crumbs over the ring if necessary.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BvLWoaNXX1UQw4m5VNPRX3Y_QYc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-82659-old-fashioned-onion-rings-DDMFS-step-5-3x4-b26b4b12fc264a8c981bb382287b0a68.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/82659/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lift again with the fork, tap any excess bread crumbs back into the dish, and place on the wire rack while you prepare the remaining onion rings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bKpOYEH_z1EvH7SvQ08rdB7PQUY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-82659-old-fashioned-onion-rings-DDMFS-step-6-3x4-14375ca4b32a43c993f39a0dea08252c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/82659/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep-fry 3 to 4 onion rings at a time in the preheated oil until golden brown, 2 to 3 minutes. Drain on paper towels while you deep-fry the remaining rings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OEg6Uchoc_VR-FGCGcltgOyZA3g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-82659-old-fashioned-onion-rings-DDMFS-step-7-3x4-9972b3cc9c4f40cbb062f0b2f754c5c8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/82659/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle with seasoning salt before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hvpVW7EDgApUkPzouwoDE0g9zNc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-82659-old-fashioned-onion-rings-DDMFS-beauty-3x4-0392e762554545be97798821fccb7e67.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/82659/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
